strings.en:
{1c:1d}{0b:08}【 Ash 】{0b:09}
A god born from people ten thousand
years ago... But this shape...{1a}Oh, I get it, Zemen and Zeweak are
fused together... But it kinda looks like it
failed partway, y'know...{1a}{10}, this is the last fight, I
guess... Don't you die, okay?{1a}All right, let's go!!{0c:021201}

{1c:11}{0b:08}【 Arthur 】{0b:09}
A god born from humans of ten
thousand years ago... But this form...{1a}I see, Zemen and Zeweak have fused...
Even so, what a misshapen fusion...{1a}{10}, this should be the final
battle. Don't you die...{1a}All right, let's go!!{0c:021101}

{1c:12}{0b:08}【 Leia 】{0b:09}
A god born from people of ten thousand
years ago... Yet this form...{1a}I see. Zemen and Zeweak have fused...
What a misshapen fusion...{1a}{10}, this will be the final battle.
Do not die...{0c:021001}

{1c:13}{0b:08}【 Eleanor 】{0b:09}
A god born of humans ten thousand
years past... and also the form of Zemen
and Zeweak fused together...{1a}Yet what a misshapen fusion it is...{1a}{10}, this should be the final
battle... Let us return to the surface
alive.{0c:020f01}

{1c:14}{0b:08}【 Pasca 】{0b:09}
A god born from folks ten thousand
years back, huh... But this shape...{1a}Right, Zemen and Zeweak are fused
together... What a twisted damn shape
it's got...{1a}{10}, this'll be the last fight, I
reckon. Don't you dare die...{1a}All right, let's go!!{0c:020e01}

